{"seq":2,"slug":"checkpoints-recovery","title":"检查点与重试：失败与再战之间的隐形骨架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-boss-encounter-design/pacing/checkpoints-recovery","wordCount":1410,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"检查点与重试-失败与再战之间的隐形骨架\">检查点与重试：失败与再战之间的隐形骨架</h1><p>硬核 Boss 战里，玩家和 Boss 交手的时间可能只占体验的一半，另一半花在「死亡—读盘—跑回去—再来」的循环里。这段循环的摩擦大小，往往比 Boss 本身的难度更能决定玩家是「再来一次」还是「删游戏」。本篇讲检查点放哪、跑图多远、重试有多快，以及回血经济如何为整套试错循环定价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-重试循环的时间构成\">核心概念：重试循环的时间构成</h2><p>一次失败到重新交手，玩家要经过若干环节。把这段「死亡税」拆开：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[玩家死亡] --&gt; B[死亡演出/黑屏]&#10;  B --&gt; C[载入检查点]&#10;  C --&gt; D[跑图回到 Boss 门口]&#10;  D --&gt; E[清理路上重生的杂兵]&#10;  E --&gt; F[入场过场动画]&#10;  F --&gt; G[重新交手]&#10;  G --&gt; H{再次失败?}&#10;  H --&gt;|是| A&#10;  H --&gt;|否| I[通关]\">flowchart TD\n  A[玩家死亡] --&gt; B[死亡演出/黑屏]\n  B --&gt; C[载入检查点]\n  C --&gt; D[跑图回到 Boss 门口]\n  D --&gt; E[清理路上重生的杂兵]\n  E --&gt; F[入场过场动画]\n  F --&gt; G[重新交手]\n  G --&gt; H{再次失败?}\n  H --&gt;|是| A\n  H --&gt;|否| I[通关]</pre><p>总死亡税 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{retry} = t_{death} + t_{load} + t_{runback} + t_{clear} + t_{intro}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">nba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这五项里，真正有价值的只有极少数（比如一小段跑图能让玩家平复情绪、重新集中），其余大多是纯摩擦。硬核动作游戏近十年的一大共识，就是<strong>尽量压缩死亡税、让玩家快速重回战斗</strong>——把学习循环（见 <a href=\"../foundations/why-boss-design\">为何 Boss 战特殊</a>）的迭代周期缩到最短，失败才能高效转化为学习。魂系游戏把存火放在 Boss 门口、《只狼》死后原地复活、以及大量游戏为 Boss 单独设即时重试，都是在削这笔税。</p>\n<h2 id=\"检查点放哪-三种策略与取舍\">检查点放哪：三种策略与取舍</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>检查点位置</th>\n<th>死亡税</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Boss 门口存点</td>\n<td>战斗区域入口</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>硬核动作、决斗 Boss</td>\n<td>削弱「探索代价」的紧张感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>即时重试</td>\n<td>Boss 战本身</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>教学 Boss、Boss Rush</td>\n<td>可能降低失败的分量感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>远程检查点</td>\n<td>上一个安全区</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>强调风险的生存/恐怖</td>\n<td>易招致「跑图惩罚」骂名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阶段检查点</td>\n<td>每个阶段开头</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>超长多阶段 raid</td>\n<td>削弱「一气呵成」的成就感</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>没有绝对最优，取决于你想让「失败」有多重的分量。生存恐怖游戏刻意保留较高死亡税来强化紧张，硬核动作游戏则倾向低摩擦以鼓励高频试错。要警惕的反模式是<strong>长跑图 + 不可跳过的入场过场</strong>的叠加：玩家已经把 Boss 前半段背得滚瓜烂熟，却每次都被迫重看一遍长动画、重跑一段路，这种摩擦纯粹消耗耐心而不产生任何学习价值。入场过场应当在首次之后可跳过。</p>\n<h2 id=\"回血经济-为试错定价\">回血经济：为试错定价</h2><p>回血资源（药瓶、回复道具、可回血的机制）是重试循环在<strong>战斗内部</strong>的对应物——它决定玩家在一场战斗里能犯多少次错。设玩家最大生命 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、单次回血量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>、回血次数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，则一场战斗的容错总量约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_p + n \\cdot h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>。这个「有效血池」除以 Boss 的平均每分钟输出，就是玩家的容错时长。</p>\n<p>回血经济和 <a href=\"../foundations/encounter-model\">遭遇战模型</a> 的「施压—松弛」深度耦合：喝药需要一个安全窗口（松弛段），如果 Boss 全程无松弛、或专门用惩罚招打断喝药（见 <a href=\"../structure/attack-patterns\">招式与模式</a> 的情境招），那么名义上的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次回血在实战中可能一次都用不出来。调回血经济时必须连着松弛节奏一起调，否则数值表上「玩家有 5 瓶药很宽容」，实战却「一瓶都喝不上」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"挫败管理-让失败可承受\">挫败管理：让失败可承受</h2><p>重试系统的终极目标不是消灭失败，而是让失败<strong>可承受、且指向进步</strong>。几条经验：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>快速反馈</strong>：死亡后尽快让玩家知道「我死于哪一招」，而非黑屏三秒后一句冰冷的 YOU DIED。清晰的死因是学习循环的燃料。</li>\n<li><strong>保留进度感</strong>：多阶段 Boss 里，让玩家感到「这次比上次多打掉一个阶段」，哪怕最终仍失败。可见的进度是坚持下去的动力。</li>\n<li><strong>降低沉没成本</strong>：死亡税越低，单次失败的「损失感」越小，玩家越愿意再试。这正是压缩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{retry}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的心理学依据。</li>\n<li><strong>可选的援助</strong>：给反复卡关的玩家提供可选的降低难度或召唤援助，避免硬性卡死。动态适配的机制见 <a href=\"../../game-difficulty-balancing/dynamic/dynamic-difficulty\">难度平衡·动态难度</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些设计共同决定了一场高难度 Boss 战是「痛并快乐着」还是「痛而已」。它们与战场的物理布局也紧密相关——跑图距离、杂兵重生点、入场位置，本质是空间问题，这是下一篇 <a href=\"arena-design\">战场设计</a> 的议题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>死亡税 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{retry}=t_{death}+t_{load}+t_{runback}+t_{clear}+t_{intro}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">nba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 大多是纯摩擦；压缩它能缩短学习循环的迭代周期，让失败高效转化为学习。</li>\n<li>检查点策略（门口存点/即时重试/远程/阶段）取决于你想让失败有多重分量；反模式是「长跑图+不可跳过过场」的叠加。</li>\n<li>回血经济给战斗内试错定价，有效血池约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_p+n\\cdot h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>；但它与松弛节奏深度耦合，无松弛则名义回血次数用不出来，必须连着一起调。</li>\n<li>重试系统目标不是消灭失败，而是让失败可承受且指向进步：快速反馈死因、保留进度感、降低沉没成本、提供可选援助。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"arena-design\">战场设计</a> —— 跑图距离、杂兵重生点、入场位置本质是空间问题。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"difficulty-curve\">难度曲线</a> —— 重试循环的迭代效率决定学习曲线能否平缓推进。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../game-difficulty-balancing/dynamic/dynamic-difficulty\">难度平衡·动态难度</a> —— 反复卡关时的可选援助与隐式调整。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../level-design/pacing-flow/pacing-tension\">关卡设计·节奏与张力</a> —— 检查点在整段关卡里的分布节奏。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"检查点与重试：失败与再战之间的隐形骨架","id":"检查点与重试-失败与再战之间的隐形骨架"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：重试循环的时间构成","id":"核心概念-重试循环的时间构成"},{"level":2,"text":"检查点放哪：三种策略与取舍","id":"检查点放哪-三种策略与取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"回血经济：为试错定价","id":"回血经济-为试错定价"},{"level":2,"text":"挫败管理：让失败可承受","id":"挫败管理-让失败可承受"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"难度曲线：一场战斗内部的起承转合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-boss-encounter-design/pacing/difficulty-curve"},"next":{"title":"战场设计：空间从来不是布景而是机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-boss-encounter-design/pacing/arena-design"}}